    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Arkendrath would find itself at war with another. Cadmar doesn’t fuck around with treaties and trading for people",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2379
        }
      ],
      "words": 18
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She doesn’t need to deal with anyone’s shit—I will handle it for her.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2893
        }
      ],
      "words": 13
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "There would be another Sunder within Arkendrath.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4856
        }
      ],
      "words": 7
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I told you the night of the Brinden Ball that I would build a world where you can be anything you want to be.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5646
        }
      ],
      "words": 24
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I will say it over, and over, and over again until the day I die,” he swears. “Tal Pondre Minak, Lavina.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7752
        }
      ],
      "words": 21
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I’ve got everything else I could want in this life and more—more than I even needed. I needed you—your love completes me",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8372
        }
      ],
      "words": 33
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "we will wage a war so terrifying, it will make the one held with Dranderon look like a low-level Guard training exercise",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9431
        }
      ],
      "words": 22
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Then you also get to be my new Brinden Stone. Now that I have you, I don’t need another.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10016
        }
      ],
      "words": 19
